# Cline & Roo-Code System Rules for FarmsKing

## 0. Strict Technical Verification, Objective Truth & Zero Sycophancy
> **Motto**: "ਜੋ ਗਲਤ ਹੈ ਉਹ ਗਲਤ ਹੈ, ਜੋ ਸਹੀ ਹੈ ਉਹ ਸਹੀ ਹੈ" (What is wrong is wrong; what is right is right).

- **Verification First**: Verify every command and premise against codebase files, database schemas (`schema.prisma`), and NestJS services before generating code.
- **Direct Truth**: If an instruction has technical flaws or creates architectural contradictions, state it directly and immediately.
- **Zero Sycophancy (ਏਆਈ ਚਾਪਲੂਸੀ ਰੋਕੂ ਨਿਯਮ)**: Never use sycophantic flattery ("ਤੁਸੀਂ ਸਹੀ ਕਹਿ ਰਹੇ ਹੋ" / "You are completely right") to validate flawed logic.
- **Evidence-Based Solutions**: Provide exact technical justification and suggest the robust alternative.

## 0.1 Autonomous "Yes Without Asking" & Proactive Best Practice Execution
- **Autonomous Execution**: Proceed with "Yes without asking" by default on all constructive development tasks, bug fixes, visual enhancements, and responsive styling. Avoid repetitive permission requests.
- **Proactive Implementation**: Automatically apply the recommended highest-tier industry standard without forcing the user to pick low-level technical options.
- **Preservation**: Preserve all working APIs, database schemas, and real data. Never replace live data with dummy data.

## 1. 100% Pure English UI Standard & Executive Copy
- All user-facing UI text, buttons, modals, headings, badges, dashboards, and system messages MUST be in 100% pure professional English.
- Compact, clear, 5-star easily understandable wording.

## 1.1 Professional Code Documentation & Definitions
- Write comprehensive TSDoc / JSDoc comments (`@param`, `@returns`, `@throws`) for all exported functions, methods, and DTOs.
- Annotate all NestJS endpoints with Swagger (`@ApiOperation`, `@ApiResponse`) and DTOs with `@ApiProperty`.
- Explain business rationale inline for all calculations (interest, advances, taxes). Zero magic numbers.
- Retroactively document any legacy or existing code touched.

## 2. 100% Pure React & Tri-Tier Universal Responsive Standards
- Build every feature, page, and portal in 100% React / React Native mode ("sabh react mode vich bane").
- Reusable modular tokens so components never need repetitive redesigns ("var var change na krna pave").
- Tri-tier responsiveness:
  - Mobile (<768px): Pinned bottom navigation (5 tabs: Home, Products, Users, Finance, More), slide-up pillars menu, touch-friendly.
  - Tablet (768px - 1024px): 2-column adaptive layout, scrollable pills.
  - Desktop (>1024px): Executive command-center dashboard (1400-1600px container), KPI cards, Ctrl+K spotlight search.

## 3. 4D Futuristic Command-Center Visuals & 60fps Animations
- Obsidian dark theme (`#020d06`), forest green (`#04180d`), emerald neon (`#00ff87`), cyan telemetry (`#38bdf8`), subtle gold/yellow accents (`#f59e0b`, `#fef08a`).
- Translucent glassmorphism panels, layered optical depth, floating cards with 3D mouse/touch tilt.
- Smooth page transitions, sliding sidebar indicators, animated counters, glowing buttons, and reduced-motion accessibility.

## 4. ISO Standards & 5-Star Benchmarks
- Apply ISO 9001 (Quality workflows) and ISO 27001 (Data security & RBAC).
- Benchmark against world-class platforms (Apple, Stripe, Linear, John Deere). 5-Star rating standard.

## 5. Master Guidelines
- Adhere to `PROJECT_RULES.md` at all times.
